{"meta":{"id":"tt1124037","type":"movie","name":"Lucha por la libertad","imdb_id":"tt1124037","description":"Narra la historia real del granjero sureño Newton Knight y su extraordinaria revuelta armada contra el Ejército Confederado durante la Guerra de Secesión americana. Harto de luchar por los intereses de los más ricos, Knight desertó, se alió con otros pequeños granjeros y con la ayuda de los esclavos locales, lideró un levantamiento que llevó al Condado de Jones en Mississippi a independizarse creando el Estado Libre de Jones. Su matrimonio con una antigua esclava, Rachel, y su posterior construcción de una comunidad interracial, distinguieron a Newton Knight como una luchadora y controvertida figura en el contexto de la Guerra Civil americana.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt1124037.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/crVDxx9KgNW7Bm1wyXqBYpzG2TS.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uq7xR6Q0pp4TR4eIoG5BnIE1ev4.png","genres":["Acción","Drama","Historia","Bélica"],"releaseInfo":"2016","released":"2016-06-24T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"140 min","imdbRating":"6.9","country":"United States of America","cast":["Matthew McConaughey","Gugu Mbatha-Raw","Mahershala Ali","Keri Russell","Jacob Lofland","Sean Bridgers","Brad Carter","Jane McNeill","Gary Grubbs","Christopher Berry","Joe Chrest","David Jensen","Kurt Krause","Carlton Caudle","Martin Bats Bradford","Matt Lintz","Kerry Cahill","Jessica Ann Collins","Juan Gaspard","Liza J. Bennett","Dave Maldonado","Serenity Neil","Lawrence Turner","Lara Grice","Wayne Péré","Jim Klock","Emily Bossak","PJ Marshall","Ritchie Montgomery","Mattie Liptak"],"director":["Gary Ross"],"writer":["Gary Ross","Leonard Hartman"],"trailers":[{"source":"3EMkxEKKSQI","type":"Trailer","name":"Free State of Jones | Official Trailer | Own It Now on Digital HD, Blu-ray, & DVD","ytId":"3EMkxEKKSQI","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"3EMkxEKKSQ